Package: CancerTrialsBR
Title: CancerTrialsBR Pipeline and Website
Version: 0.2.0
Description: R pipeline that downloads oncology clinical trials recruiting in
    Brazil from ClinicalTrials.gov, enriches them with LLMs and geolocates
    research sites, plus the Quarto website that documents it.
Imports:
    httr,
    jsonlite,
    dplyr,
    glue,
    pbapply,
    ellmer,
    stringi,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
